	(text "RV-3032-C7: backup switchover is DISABLED on delivery.\nFirmware must write EEPROM C0h: BSM=10 (LSM), TCM=00 (trickle charger off, primary cell),\noptionally NCLKE=1 to stop the 32.768kHz CLKOUT. Persist with EERD=1, then EECMD (3Fh) = 11h (update all config EEPROM)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
